@startuml booking-state
!include _style.puml
title Booking Lifecycle
left to right direction

state "Available\n(suy ra, không lưu)" as Available
state "Held\nRedis TTL 300s" as Held #FFF5EA
state "Confirmed\nPostgreSQL" as Confirmed #FFF1E6
state "Expired\nterminal hold" as Expired
state "Cancelled\nPostgreSQL" as Cancelled

[*] --> Available
Available --> Held : createHold [slot free] / Lua NX+TTL
Held --> Confirmed : confirm [owner+token+TTL+no conflict]\n/ insert booking+outbox
Held --> Expired : TTL elapsed / Redis deletes
Held --> Available : release [owner] / compare-and-delete
Confirmed --> Cancelled : cancel [participant] / outbox event
Confirmed --> Confirmed : repeated confirm same hold / return existing
Cancelled --> Cancelled : repeated cancel / no-op
Expired --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note bottom of Confirmed
Không có PendingTutorApproval trong phiên bản đầu.
Exclusion constraint bảo vệ race condition.
end note
@enduml

